{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twelve Mental Patients</strong> is a psychological horror game where you play as a mad doctor who arrives at an abandoned psychiatric hospital to end the suffering of patients who can no longer be saved. With each victim, you inch closer to the edge of your own madness, balancing on the brink of insanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo version includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One map to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of items available in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo allows you to experience the basic game mechanics. The full version offers more maps, items, and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/9c07ade26c1c1fdfb788f6560f208d94.poster.avif?t=1761937203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/9c07ade26c1c1fdfb788f6560f208d94.webm?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/9c07ade26c1c1fdfb788f6560f208d94.mp4?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>\ud83d\udd2a Kill </strong>incurable patients</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/f6a6cfc317a41807626587a6cbd5a168.poster.avif?t=1761937203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/f6a6cfc317a41807626587a6cbd5a168.webm?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/f6a6cfc317a41807626587a6cbd5a168.mp4?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\udd25 Burn </strong>dead bodies in the furnace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/d89a8c904c37238b432ae40052f833ff.poster.avif?t=1761937203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/d89a8c904c37238b432ae40052f833ff.webm?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/d89a8c904c37238b432ae40052f833ff.mp4?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\udd28 Repair</strong> the broken furnace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/d2c63f49f8f03aa5a98a58970b81ae9d.poster.avif?t=1761937203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/d2c63f49f8f03aa5a98a58970b81ae9d.webm?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/extras/d2c63f49f8f03aa5a98a58970b81ae9d.mp4?t=1761937203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd2b\u00a0<strong>Kill</strong> the returning dead patients </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features: </strong><br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, dark audiovisual design that amplifies the sense of dread and isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the twelve patients has a unique message that you uncover during gameplay.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sanity loss system \u2013 the more you kill, the more you lose control over your own mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges that require both reflexes and difficult moral decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to face the challenge and hold on to the last remnants of your sanity? Remember, every move you make could mean your own end..</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106200?t=1761937203","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106200/2401898d7964164dccf51fa2e50c99a95fd091c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761937203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite